v0.1.9.2-beta: Chat commands /set2nd and /seteco + secondary stats fix

New chat commands:
- /set2nd [name|#|off] — set or disable secondary provider for active provider
- /seteco [1|0] — toggle Eco Mode on the active provider

Bug fix:
- Secondary provider usage now correctly tracked in statistics when used for search/skill re-calls
- Stats record secondary provider name/model instead of primary when secondary handles re-call
